# MAGIC ## Approaches to Model Inferencing with Spark
# MAGIC ### Batch, streaming, and real-time
# MAGIC
# MAGIC <div style="max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
# MAGIC <p style="font-size:1.02em;line-height:1.65;color:#33414B;margin:0 0 18px;"><b>Purpose:</b> Spark supports three inference patterns. Batch and streaming run on the cluster; low-latency real-time is better served by a model serving endpoint (not Spark ML).</p>
