# MAGIC ## Parallel Inference on Spark with MLflow
# MAGIC ### Turn a logged model into a Spark UDF
# MAGIC
# MAGIC <div style="max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
# MAGIC <p style="font-size:1.02em;line-height:1.65;color:#33414B;margin:0 0 18px;"><b>Purpose:</b> <code>mlflow.pyfunc.spark_udf</code> wraps a logged model as a Spark UDF, so even a single-node model scores across DataFrame partitions in parallel &mdash; loaded once per Python process for efficiency.</p>
# MAGIC <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;margin-top:0;"><div style="flex:1 1 250px;min-width:230px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#F9F7F4;border:1px solid rgba(27,81,98,0.28);border-radius:10px;padding:16px 18px 18px;"><div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" width="34" height="34" aria-hidden="true" style="flex:0 0 34px;display:block;"><g fill="none" stroke="#FF5F46" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 4 v14 M11 13 l5 5 l5 -5"/><rect x="5" y="22" width="22" height="6" rx="2"/></g></svg><div style="min-width:0;"><div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.7px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#FF5F46;line-height:1.3;">Step 1</div><div style="font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0b2026;line-height:1.3;margin-top:3px;">Load the model</div></div></div><p style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#33414B;">Load a Python-function-formatted model from the MLflow Model Registry.</p></div><div style="flex:1 1 250px;min-width:230px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#F9F7F4;border:1px solid rgba(27,81,98,0.28);border-radius:10px;padding:16px 18px 18px;"><div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" width="34" height="34" aria-hidden="true" style="flex:0 0 34px;display:block;"><g fill="none" stroke="#FF5F46" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 12 h16 l-4 -4 M22 12 M26 20 h-16 l4 4"/><rect x="3" y="6" width="6" height="6" rx="1"/><rect x="23" y="18" width="6" height="6" rx="1"/></g></svg><div style="min-width:0;"><div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.7px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#FF5F46;line-height:1.3;">Step 2</div><div style="font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0b2026;line-height:1.3;margin-top:3px;">Convert to a UDF</div></div></div><p style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#33414B;"><code>spark_udf</code> turns the MLflow model into a Spark User-Defined Function.</p></div><div style="flex:1 1 250px;min-width:230px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#F9F7F4;border:1px solid rgba(27,81,98,0.28);border-radius:10px;padding:16px 18px 18px;"><div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" width="34" height="34" aria-hidden="true" style="flex:0 0 34px;display:block;"><g fill="none" stroke="#FF5F46" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="6" width="24" height="5" rx="1.5"/><rect x="4" y="13.5" width="18" height="5" rx="1.5"/><rect x="4" y="21" width="24" height="5" rx="1.5"/></g></svg><div style="min-width:0;"><div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.7px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#FF5F46;line-height:1.3;">Step 3</div><div style="font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0b2026;line-height:1.3;margin-top:3px;">Apply in parallel</div></div></div><p style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#33414B;">Distribute inference across DataFrame partitions with <code>withColumn</code>.</p></div></div><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;align-items:stretch;margin-top:18px;"><div style="flex:1 1 360px;min-width:320px;background:#F4F5F6;border:1px solid #C9CDD1;border-radius:4px;padding:14px 16px;overflow-x:auto;"><div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.7px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#618794;margin-bottom:8px;">Classic — load as a Python function</div><pre style="margin:0;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#1C2733;white-space:pre;">model = mlflow.pyfunc.load_model(model_path)
# MAGIC model.predict(model_input)</pre></div><div style="flex:1 1 460px;min-width:380px;background:#F4F5F6;border:1px solid #C9CDD1;border-radius:4px;padding:14px 16px;overflow-x:auto;"><div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.7px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#618794;margin-bottom:8px;">Spark — convert to a Spark UDF</div><pre style="margin:0;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#1C2733;white-space:pre;"><span style="color:#6E8B6E;font-style:italic;"># Load the input table as a Spark DataFrame</span>
